    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b952e72c9916636ec91b3af8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尊贵的吾君！请您务必在特等席上…\n尽量披上帅气的披风，\n聆听您骑士的歌声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6190109f7d73585704ed4549b6b8b612d67601a6e1985b01ebfbdd79884d2a9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "400002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/400002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02da137377427de0d54dc279",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然参加被拒绝了，但她一直耐心\n地看我们练习……信念小姐，\n真是个笃实的人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da39683f6029e13cda41d072a35e019ba33dae4fc23f5a6864e6948a52fab5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "400005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/400005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05aac6d21a173668a8ffcaea",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的圣剑比闪电还要耀眼，\r\n拥有劈开黑暗的锋芒……\r\n请看吧！帕拉提纳斯·卢克斯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a3ecef74aa60b4122bcb8efeea4f718ac0e5db46cc508a6c6b642eba761792b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "40001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/40001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a5d31333c7fd9676a93527",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终游戏对决以3亿对3败北…  \n哼，我可不是会在这里气馁的人！  \n一定要再战，奇迹小姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f320a1aef63fe45329093c147ffc94c3c520f20532aba5a253d6a4caccc56ddb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "400010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/400010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:260007b8287929bc7cab8a04",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来吧，前往闪耀的喝彩之海！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f12a029624a777820a411dd6cf8d7afa192e77bcd66d925196f0812a687ea3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "60000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/60000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f1a92d83ec0be61dc47868",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向民众表达感激吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c92296aa7e7834fa2f011bc22cc3a5c8c5ea9dd132fa07fe2cfbc4756325de9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "60001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/60001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd229048109c4f7f91a65ceb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此身既是您的剑——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fac55dbadf08633fb9e0d33dfaf5e8a7d064d3d2cf18e0551f4fd47fa3e8209",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/70000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8dfbe88ac781b47522a5a2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是您的骑士多旺达，\r\n还记得我们叙事诗的开端吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3e1827fae3bd6f26cfc531c7e0cccbb89ad02f5f949b26ebb36295b9a5ddfff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "70001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1121/70001"
    },
