      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母亲教给了我许多事情。\r\n比如蹄铁的保养、腿部护理等。\r\n这些都成为了我如今的宝贵财富。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c1a7256c63320684014713a788e76cd25959d1b9be5683a17089bef8d0bc7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
