    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8f4729c9c5b56251a905e3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的招式名称……？\r\n若要说的话，或许是天启吧……\r\n只是心中有种无法抑制的呼喊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6dc13f16ac2e78784878359d7f13d6aaaad950e14631762e1afce002503ad95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
